<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Pterodactyl Panel Resource Notification Bot | 吳鑽 (Wuzuan)</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Pterodactyl Discord Bot - 專為 Pterodactyl 面板設計的 Discord 通知與管理機器人">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/images/favicon.png?v=2">
    <link rel="shortcut icon" href="/images/favicon.png?v=2" type="image/png">
    <meta name="keywords"
        content="Wuzuan, 吳鑽, Pterodactyl Bot, Discord Bot, Pterodactyl Panel, Resource Notification, 伺服器管理, Wing Panel, 翼龍面板, Node.js, Discord.js">
    <meta name="author" content="Wuzuan">


    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/ink-fonts.css?v=2">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css?v=24">
    <link rel="preload" href="/fonts/ink/wuzuan-ink-400-core-v1.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin>
    <link rel="preload" href="/fonts/ink/wuzuan-ink-700-core-v1.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://unpkg.com/aos@2.3.1/dist/aos.css" rel="stylesheet" media="print" onload="this.media='all'">
    <noscript>
        <link href="https://unpkg.com/aos@2.3.1/dist/aos.css" rel="stylesheet">
    </noscript>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="background-animation"></div>

    <nav class="navbar project-navbar">
        <div class="container">
            <a href="/" class="logo" aria-label="Wuzuan 首頁"><img class="brand-wordmark" src="/images/identity/wuzuan-wordmark.svg?v=2" alt="Wuzuan" width="126" height="42"><img class="brand-spark" src="/images/identity/spark.svg?v=2" alt="" width="21" height="21"></a>
            <ul class="nav-links">
                <li><a href="/">首頁</a></li>
                <li><a href="/#portfolio">作品集</a></li>
                <li><a href="/#contact">聯絡</a></li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <header class="project-hero">
        <div class="container">
            <a href="/#portfolio" class="back-link">
                <%- include('partials/icon', { name: 'arrow-left' }) %> 返回作品集
            </a>
            <h1 data-aos="fade-right">Pterodactyl Panel Resource Notification Bot</h1>
            <div class="project-meta" data-aos="fade-right" data-aos-delay="100">
                <span><%- include('partials/icon', { name: 'discord' }) %> Discord Bot</span>
                <span><%- include('partials/icon', { name: 'code' }) %> Node.js</span>
                <span><%- include('partials/icon', { name: 'server' }) %> Pterodactyl Panel</span>
            </div>
            <div class="cta-buttons" style="justify-content: center;" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
                <a href="https://discord.com/oauth2/authorize?client_id=1431556086204338267" target="_blank"
                    class="btn btn-primary">
                    <%- include('partials/icon', { name: 'robot' }) %> 邀請機器人
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <section class="section">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="project-content">
                <h2 data-aos="fade-up">專案介紹</h2>
                <p data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
                    這是一個專為 Pterodactyl (翼龍) 面板設計的 Discord 機器人，旨在協助伺服器管理者即時監控伺服器資源使用情況，並透過 Discord 發送自動化警報。
                </p>

                <h2 data-aos="fade-up">主要功能</h2>
                <div class="feature-grid">
                    <div class="feature-card" data-aos="zoom-in" data-aos-delay="100">
                        <div class="feature-icon">
                            <%- include('partials/icon', { name: 'chart-pie' }) %>
                        </div>
                        <h3>即時資源監控</h3>
                        <ul>
                            <li>全方位監控 CPU、RAM 與 Disk 使用率</li>
                            <li>資源超標時自動發送 Discord 警報</li>
                            <li>即時掌握伺服器健康狀態</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                    <div class="feature-card" data-aos="zoom-in" data-aos-delay="200">
                        <div class="feature-icon">
                            <%- include('partials/icon', { name: 'gamepad' }) %>
                        </div>
                        <h3>強大的互動介面</h3>
                        <ul>
                            <li>支援現代化 Slash Commands 指令</li>
                            <li>直覺的按鈕開關介面 (Buttons)</li>
                            <li>支援多伺服器列表分頁瀏覽</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                    <div class="feature-card" data-aos="zoom-in" data-aos-delay="300">
                        <div class="feature-icon">
                            <%- include('partials/icon', { name: 'language' }) %>
                        </div>
                        <h3>多語言支援 (i18n)</h3>
                        <ul>
                            <li>內建繁/簡中、英、日、韓等多國語言</li>
                            <li>自動偵測 Discord 用戶端語言設定</li>
                            <li>無縫切換，提供在地化體驗</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                    <div class="feature-card" data-aos="zoom-in" data-aos-delay="400">
                        <div class="feature-icon">
                            <%- include('partials/icon', { name: 'robot' }) %>
                        </div>
                        <h3>靈活的安裝方式</h3>
                        <ul>
                            <li>支援 Server Bot (伺服器機器人) 模式</li>
                            <li>支援 User App (使用者應用程式) 模式</li>
                            <li>適用於私人管理或公開社群服務</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <h2 data-aos="fade-up">快速指令</h2>
                <ul class="command-list">
                    <li class="command-item" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
                        <span class="command-code">/setup</span>
                        <span class="command-desc">初始化設定，連結您的 Pterodactyl 面板 API。</span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="command-item" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
                        <span class="command-code">/notification-setup</span>
                        <span class="command-desc">設定資源通知，選擇要監控的伺服器。</span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="command-item" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="300">
                        <span class="command-code">/help</span>
                        <span class="command-desc">查看幫助選單與更多指令說明。</span>
                    </li>
                </ul>

                <h2 data-aos="fade-up">使用技術</h2>
                <div class="tech-stack" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
                    <span class="tech-badge"><%- include('partials/icon', { name: 'node' }) %> Node.js</span>
                    <span class="tech-badge"><%- include('partials/icon', { name: 'discord' }) %> Discord.js v14</span>
                    <span class="tech-badge"><%- include('partials/icon', { name: 'database' }) %> SQL.js / SQLite</span>
                    <span class="tech-badge"><%- include('partials/icon', { name: 'server' }) %> Pterodactyl Client API</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="footer" data-aos="fade-up">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="footer-meta">
                <p class="copyright">&copy;
                    <script>document.write(new Date().getFullYear())</script> Wuzuan. All rights reserved.
                </p>
                <p class="last-updated" data-update-mode="<%= updateTime.mode %>" title="<%= updateTime.source %>">
                    <span>最後更新</span>
                    <time datetime="<%= updateTime.iso %>"><%= updateTime.display %></time>
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </footer>
    <script defer src="/js/update-time.js?v=3"></script>
    <script src="https://unpkg.com/aos@2.3.1/dist/aos.js"></script>
    <script>
        if (typeof AOS !== 'undefined') AOS.init({
            duration: 800,
            once: true,
            offset: 100
        });
    </script>
</body>

</html>
